<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE FLEXIBILITY</view><view class="heading">错过的一天，也可以补上。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">登录查看权益</button></view><block wx:else><view class="hero section"><text class="pill light">会员每月补卡</text><view class="hero-title">{{rights.remaining}}<text class="unit">次剩余</text></view><view class="hero-desc">当月额度 {{rights.monthly}} 次 · 已用 {{rights.used}} 次</view></view><view class="card section"><view class="form-label">选择本月过去未签到的日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{rights.min}}" end="{{rights.max}}" disabled="{{!canChoose}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{date}} ⌄</view></picker><text class="caption">只消耗当前会员卡配置的补卡次数，不支持跨月或补未来日期。</text><button class="btn mt" disabled="{{busy || !canChoose}}" bindtap="backfill">消耗一次，即时补卡</button><text wx:if="{{!canChoose}}" class="caption">暂无补卡额度，或本月还没有可补的过去日期。</text></view><view class="card section"><view class="title">会员与日常提醒</view><text class="caption">原型中保存提醒偏好及模拟授权，不会向微信实际发送消息。</text><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/personal-services/index" bindtap="go">消息与提醒设置 ›</button></view><button class="btn ghost section" data-url="/pages/membership/index" bindtap="go">查看会员套餐与有效期</button></block></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
